--- Configuration table for Perlin noise functions.
---
--- Provides optional parameters to control behavior of perlin_noise2
--- and fractal_perlin2. All fields are optional and default values
--- are used when omitted.
---
--- @class PerlinArguments
--- @field scale number?           Input coordinate scaling factor. Lower values zoom out (larger features), higher values zoom in (finer details).
--- @field lacunarity number?      Frequency multiplier per octave when used in fractal noise.
--- @field persistence number?     Amplitude multiplier per octave when used in fractal noise.
